      "arabic": "١١٥٥٦- عويش:\nخاطب بها النّبيّ ﵌ عائشة أم المؤمنين.\nأورده الطّبرانيّ في العشرة من طريق مسلم بن يسار، قال: بلغني أنّ النبيّ ﵌ دخل على عائشة فقال: «يا عويش، ما لي أراك أشرق وجهك ...»\nالحديث.",
      "english": "11556—Uwaysh:\n\nThe Prophet—may Allah bless him and grant him peace—addressed Aisha, Mother of the Believers, by this name.\n\nAl-Tabarani included it in al-Ishra by way of Muslim ibn Yasar, who said: “It has reached me that the Prophet—may Allah bless him and grant him peace—entered upon Aisha and said, ‘O Uwaysh, how is it that I see your face radiant …’”—and the rest of the hadith.",
